        <mxCell id="p3-foot-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left;line-height:1.35;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#607086;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;典型顺序：建模（01）→ 评估（02）→ 解释（04 / 05 / 03 / 06 / 07）。解释层四条链路彼此独立，可按需要单独运行。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=28;fontColor=#607086;" vertex="1" parent="1">
